    "reading_time_min": 2,
    "language": "en",
    "featured": false,
    "content": "---\nid: \"khulumpa\"\ntitle: \"ꯈꯨ꯬ꯂꯨ꯬ꯝꯄꯥ  Khulumpa\"\nsummary: \"ꯈꯨ꯬ꯂꯨ꯬ꯝꯄꯥ\"\ndate: \"2026-11-11\"\nauthor: \"Yawol Khongthang Kangleipak\"\ncategory: \"Philosophy\"\nthumbnail: \"images/sllk-photo-hd-200kb.jpg\"\nlanguage: \"en\"\nfeatured: false\n---\n\n![sllk-photo-hd-200kb.jpg](images/sllk-photo-hd-200kb.jpg)\n\n\n\n**ꯈꯨ꯬ꯂꯨ꯬ꯝꯄꯥ**  ****Khulumpa****\n\nWakoklon heelel thilel salai ama-Elon pukok puya ebada hourakpada hairiba asi yengbiyu. \n\n\" ꯱• Hung, Hei, Ha, Hey \" khoiyum Lainingthou\" Atigaa koilou sitapa pu khulumna echake.\n\nMathak ki puyadagi louthokpa wahei pareng asida yaoriba wahei ꯈꯨ.ꯂꯨ꯬ꯝꯅꯥ (khulumna) haiba wahei asida khu, lum haiba haiba wahei machet ani asida \"ꯈꯨ꯬\" dasu Lum (.) namme, aduga \"ꯂꯨ꯬ꯝ\" dasu Lum (.) namme. Maram asina mafam asida Eriba khulumna haiba asi eikhoina houjik sijinariba \"Khurumba\" haiba hindugi matamda sijinramba wahei asidi natte. Houjik eikhoina sijinariba wahei \"Khurumba\" haibasidi maong kayada pangthok e, Dhandabot touduna khurumba, khut lonnaduna khurumba asinachingba. Maram asina matang asida Aebana haijaningbadi, mafam asida  khulumPa ,KhuLumna puya da sijinariba asidi Kangleicha, meetei sing (maru oina nupi sing) na khurumbagi maong asiga amatani. Khudam oina Lai haraobagi Laimangda \"Khuna Leipakta taraga (souraga) leipakta khu souraga khurumba asi khaktani.\n\nEikhoi kangleicha meetei singna hindugi mamangda dhandabot toubagi chatnabi leirakte. \n\nPuya da yaoriba khulumpa, Khulumna haiba khurumba maong asi South East Asia da thailand na chingba mafam da chatnei. Mafam asida aebana haijaribadi puya da yaoriba \"Khulumna\" haiba waheina taklibasi eikhoina houjik chatnariba hindugi matamgi khurumba gi maong asi tasengba kangleicha meeteigi maong natte, kangleicha meetei gidi thailand na chingba mafamda chatnariba maong Khu leitaraga khurumba asini haijabni. \n\n\n\n\n **MINGKHEIROL**\n\n- Hung Hei Ha He. Khoiyum Lainingthou Ating-aa Koilou Sitapa Mingkhei, Lailol\n\n- Hung Hei Ha He Hing. Yaipilel Mingkhei, Lainingthou Sanamahee Mingkhei Lailol\n\n- Ha Hung Hei He Hing. Eepung Loinapa Mahak Ki Mingkei Lailon. Mingkhei Lailol Asibu  Konchen Tukthapa  Epu Athoupa Pakhangpa Na Fangchakhiye\n\n- Hei Ha. Ema Epa Gi Mingkhei. \n\n> - Eema Ahum Gi Mingkhei. \n\n- 1. Leitonta Leipi Eeyek Leima Ema Epem ma\n\n- 2. Leiyaita Leipi Lai khulempi Ema Epem ma\n \n- 3. Laiyengta Leipi  Leinoutapi Ema Epem ma\n Ema Ahum Ki Mingkhei Ti\nNung Talang Talengpi Kouwe. Asi Haina Leilem \nMapu Punemcha o . \n Eikhoina Puya Lairik Paba Matamda Haigadouba Mingkheini. \n\n- Ama \nTala \nCha \nLeesing \nLeesing Tala \nLeecha\nLeecha Tala\nLeepun\nLeepun Tala\nLeepot\nLeepot Tala\nLee Kei\nLeekei Tala\nPu Ama. \nMapu Mahak Ki Thouwai Michak Cheising Singthalon Mingkhei.\n"
